    "text": "<p>In the given reaction sequence, the major product &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&#39;&nbsp;is :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><munder><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mover><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><munder><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi>Br</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><munder><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>alcoholic</mi></mover><mi>KOH</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p>",
