    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a768107f-9694-4157-bc21-63b89b832828-6c52b7a3-7a46-4f6a-818f-b96b15fde1ef-image.png\" style=\"width: 553px; height: 148px;\" /></p><p>In first step nitration of benzene ring will take place at para position, since ethyl group is ortho-para directing in nature.&nbsp;</p><p>Then halogenation&nbsp;reaction will take place at benzyl position followed by dehydrohalogenation&nbsp;reaction with alcoholic KOH.</p>",
